Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:36.03,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,MENGUKUR CINTA DENGAN ANGKA ITU KACAU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku panglima tertinggi?!\NTamatlah sudah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seminim apa bakat di kerajaan ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, ini menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku yakin kau sendiri\Nyang undang situasi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, memang, kemampuan bumerangmu\Ntidak ada tandingannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terserahlah! Bilang saja\Ndi mana Kerajaan Fanoss sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka terus mendekati ibu kota kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena mereka sedang melawan\Nmonster-monster raksasa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi meski kemajuan mereka lambat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cuma kurang dari 24 jam lagi\Nmereka akan tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, ini akan terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Prioritaskan evakuasi warga sipil.\NPakai semua orang yang punya kapal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ya. Utus Daniel\Ndan yang lain untuk bantu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak mau utus mereka ke barisan depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu cuma berarti orang lain yang akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kukeluarkan perintah militer sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama-tama, kita butuh kapal kerajaan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kita tidak bisa aktifkan itu,\Nkita sudah kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}The World of Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim 2: The World\Nof Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa aku harus ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang. Kemungkinan besar\Nkalian bisa pakai kapal kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ukurannya lebih besar dari yang kukira.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih kecil dari Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya cukup kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya tidak bisa diandalkan\Ndibanding Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desainnya sangat bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa dibandingkan\Ndengan kemampuan Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kompetitif sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph. Familiarmu suka sombong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di-Dia kompetitif.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bahkan dia\Ntidak bisa menggerakkan kapal ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang bisa menggerakkannya
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cuma kekuatan cinta!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.79,0:03:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam gim, kalau level kasih sayang\Ntidak mencapai batas yang ditentukan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita tidak bisa aktifkan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat dua orang yang benar-benar\Nsaling cinta berdiri di sampingnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kapal kerajaan akan terima mereka\Nsebagai tuan dan tunjukkan kekuatannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Itu tidak ada di gim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keturunan pahlawan berkumpul di sini.\NIni juga pasti sebuah takdir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leluhur mereka pahlawan\Nyang bertarung lawan Kerajaan Fanoss,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan yang temani kelompok mereka\Nadalah leluhur Livia, Saint pertama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak peduli cerita dan melewatkan\Nbagian itu, andai kubaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya kapal kerajaan\Ncuma akan terima keturunan pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yakin kau tidak punya tempat di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Li-Lidah Raja sangat berduri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia punya masalah denganku\Natau semacamnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kulakukan cuma hajar putranya\Ndan dekati istrinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh. Ya, pasti itu penyebabnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kalian sudah siap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perangkat ini tidak kenal ampun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.01,0:04:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Izinkan kami tunjukkan cara pakainya.\NYang Mulia siap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Kali ini,\Nkita mungkin bisa menggerakkan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 25! Wanita: 58! Sayang sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Argh! 25?! Apa itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita ini cuma orang asing\Natau sekadar kenalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.25,0:05:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kau cuma 58!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ci-Cinta... dengan angka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemungkinan besar ini semacam gimmick pesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya kapal ini dibangun\Nmanusia masa lampau untuk hiburan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini dibangun sebelum tubuh utamaku dibangun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ia dipakai cuma sekali\Nuntuk bulan madu sebelum dibuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ia terdaftar dengan nama Vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa keluarga kerajaan punya itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Alasannya tidak diketahui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:06:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, pasangan yang pakai itu\Ncerai setelah dua tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak peduli...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Parah! Kau sangat kejam! Kau sangat bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa ada yang percaya\Nmereka bisa tunjukkan cinta sejatinya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie! Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu perasaanmu soal kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajar kalau kau tidak puas\Ndengan dalih kita yang menyedihkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cinta bersinar paling terang\Ndi tengah kesulitan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Julius...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, saatnya tunjukkan cinta kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 90! Wanita: 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Heh. Ini kenyataan. Akan kuterima.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tidak kusangka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suatu hari nanti,\Nakan kubuat kau memperhatikanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau cuma dapat 17 darinya!\NItu terlalu optimis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang Mulia, maaf,\Ntapi hari itu takkan pernah datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena akan kubuktikan cintaku dengan Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 89! Wanita: 12!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.19,0:07:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu menyedihkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau harus bilang bagian terakhir itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf karena aku kalah dari Yang Mulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi Marie, suatu hari nanti,\Nakan kubuat kau memperhatikanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minggir! Aku berikutnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 91! Wanita: 22!\NSemangat juang tidak bawa kau ke mana-mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan komentarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie, aku takkan pernah menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berikutnya giliranku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berjuang gagah berani\Nsaat karyawisata. Pasti...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 87! Wanita: 31!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balas kebaikan dengan kedengkian!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya, giliranku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lebih rupawan daripada yang lain!\NMarie pasti akan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria: 98! Wanita: 9! Pulanglah, Pemimpi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup. Aku tidak sanggup lihat ini lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku yang paling rendah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semuanya, bukan begitu!\NBiar kujelaskan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudahlah. Tidak apa-apa, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar kami tidak layak\Nmendapatkan cintamu saat ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami takkan pernah menyerah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami pasti akan mendapatkan cintamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius, biar kujelaskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan angka mereka setinggi itu!\NTapi kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau cuma dapat 40\Nsaat kali pertama kita bertemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mau cinta dalam pernikahan politis?\NSeharusnya kunikahi wanita yang kucintai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?! Seharusnya aku bilang\Nhal yang sama padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hubungan mereka tidak bisa diperbaiki...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, Raja cuma berpura-pura\Nsoal segalanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, kapal itu akan bergerak dengan cinta?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, itu akan bergerak\Nkalau kita punya cinta?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sepertinya begitu, tapi cinta itu rumit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa kita cuma perlu\Nserahkan ini ke Luxion...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa? Kenapa kalian pegang lenganku?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Tidak! Aku tidak mau naik itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, tolong naik.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini akan membuat semuanya sangat jelas.\NJangan hindari lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mentalku tidak sekuat mental Julius!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau yang terburuk terjadi,\Naku takkan sanggup hadapi itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memalukan kalau angkaku terlalu tinggi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bersemangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selalu sembunyikan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi canggung kalau terlalu rendah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mengerikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya bisa menjadi tragedi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mengerikan! Kalian sedingin es!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak menginginkan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayolah, kalian berdua!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ukur cinta pakai angka itu kacau!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, lakukan sesuatu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terapkan standar ganda antara kau\Ndan orang lain tidak pantas bagi manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam, dasar pengkhianat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:10:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sempurna. Aku sangat kesal\Ndengan ekspresi sombongmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang naiklah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini akan segera berakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuatkan dirimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naik! Naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benci kalian semua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}120 dari keduanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua terikat cinta sejati!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ange?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Livia, kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu... Aku senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasakan hal yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tidak pertimbangkan dua orang\Nberjenis kelamin sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ini bisa dianggap benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejujurnya, aku agak berharap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir kami takkan\Ndapat hasil seperti Yang Mulia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sekarang...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sejak kapan ceritanya jadi\Nkaum gay yang jadi penyelamat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:11:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Leon, aku tidak tahu\Nharus bilang apa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma karakter mob\Nyang hadir sebagai selingan komedi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Livia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ange.\N- Tuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita masih punya pekerjaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Jalan!\N- Bawa semuanya sebisa kalian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Pastikan ini berhasil!\N- Gulingkan Kerajaan Fanoss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini untuk Mile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian yakin mau pergi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Kami keturunan petualang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami pasti akan berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluargaku bertarung di luar sana.\NAku harus bertarung juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang Mulia, cepat evakuasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, aku harus lakukan sesuatu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau ikut menyerang,\Nkau akan kehilangan nyawa dengan sia-sia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semua orang akan bertarung!\NBagaimana bisa aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tugasmu bertahan hidup, memastikan\Ngaris keturunan kerajaan tidak putus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada baju besi atau kapal untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mundurlah dan ikut evakuasi denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku yakin Keluarga Redgrave masih ada...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau putuskan pertunangan dengan Angelica.\NKau pikir mereka mau bantu kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keputusan burukmu sebabkan ini.\NKau harus bertanggung jawab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, aku mengantuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, semua orang akan siap bergerak\Ndalam satu jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Persiapan akan selesai sebelum pasukan\NKerajaan Fanoss dan monster tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus. Bagaimana dengan Vice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berjalan lancar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi, lagi! Tambahkan kekuatan cinta!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi! Lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Berapa lama kita harus begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus kalahkan bos akhir\Ndengan kekuatan cinta mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cinta, ya?\NKalau cinta sejati adalah jawabannya,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bagaimana dengan seluruh cinta\Nyang meresap ke seluruh dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah! Mana aku tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah terlihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial, sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Tuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya beda dari gim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bilang ada dua?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Monster raksasa dari laut akan tiba\Nkira-kira dalam enam jam juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya Kerajaan Holfort\Nakhirnya sudah bergerak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri Hertrude,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa masih ada waktu\Nuntuk kau hentikan perang ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah sangat terlambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss sudah bertahan\Nselama berabad-abad demi hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Adikku tukar hidupnya\Nuntuk panggil Dewa Penjaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ia takkan berhenti\Nsampai selesaikan perintahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini, kalian yang akan diinjak-injak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tindakan-tindakan kebiadaban\Nyang dilakukan Kerajaan Fanoss
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terhadap Kerajaan Holfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Termasuk ganti rugi yang harus\Ndibayarkan Kerajaan Fanoss
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ke Kerajaan Holfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong kosong apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss berjuang demi kemerdekaan\Ndari Kerajaan Holfort
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setelah ketidakadilan tak terhitung!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau cuma disuguhi upaya tutup-tutupi fakta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka cuma ajarkan kau\Nversi sejarah yang dipelintir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Kerajaan Fanoss,\Nmantan archduke Kerajaan Holfort,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pernah pakai kekuasaan dan kedudukan\Nuntuk lakukan kekejaman luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatan militernya besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia rampas tanah, kekayaan,\Ndan nyawa banyak bangsawan daerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Holfort angkat\NKeluarga Field sebagai margrave,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kucurkan dana dan sumber daya\Nbesar untuk hadapi dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, Archduke sudah kumpulkan\Nkekuatan sangat besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namai wilayahnya sebagai Kerajaan Fanoss,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia berulang kali menyerbu wilayah tetangga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Holfort dan Margrave Field\Ntidak bisa diam dan cuma nonton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka utus semua pasukan\Nuntuk tekan Archduke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan Kerajaan Fanoss kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka janjikan ganti rugi\Nke Kerajaan Holfort,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi mereka terus melawan,\Ndengan kerugian besar di kedua negara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu tidak mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belum lama ini,\NKerajaan Holfort invasi Kerajaan Fanoss
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk rebut kembali tanah-tanah\Nyang sebelumnya diambil Archduke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak! Kerajaan Fanoss berjuang\Ndemi dapatkan kemerdekaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Holfort paksa dia\Nsepakati perjanjian yang tidak adil!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami cuma menuntut ganti rugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup! Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tehnya sudah dingin.\NAkan kuseduh teh baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar Kerajaan Holfort\Nmenyerang Kerajaan Fanoss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kau tidak boleh lupakan\Nrangkaian peristiwa yang menyebabkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat orang angkat senjata,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka selalu punya alasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa? Ini terlalu cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:16:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Detasemen. Derau elektronik\Nsebabkan penundaan deteksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita terlalu percaya diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berapa banyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada 30 kapal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Unit komando dan kendaraan lapis baja\Nsudah menyusup ke ibu kota kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sudah menyusup ke kota.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan udara dari tubuh utamaku\Nakan sulit dilakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, kita akan hadapi mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perintah mundur diterima. Mundur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tidak pernah bergerak sama sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Tidak sedikit pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemilik sialan itu dibebaskan\Nsetelah buktikan tuduhannya tidak benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Salah tuduh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan keamanan lapis baja\Nsudah hadapi mereka,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalah jumlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musuh menuju ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bergerak dari langit\Ndi atas Distrik Dua menuju Distrik Tiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Kita mulai dari sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seseorang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamatkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lari!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke sini! Ada kapal menunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Clarice, di sini bahaya!\NHarap ikut evakuasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku putri menteri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa lari\Nsaat rakyatku dalam bahaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Kami warga sipil!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini untuk tentara Kerajaan Fanoss\Nyang kalian bunuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian akan tebus dosa kalian!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua,\Nsampah Kerajaan Holfort, akan mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Badai Mawar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senior Deirdre? Kenapa kau kemari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin sama dengan yang bawa kau ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana bangsawan bisa hadapi\Nrakyat kerajaan ini kalau kita lari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau punya semangat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berlututlah di hadapanku dan mohon ampun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubiarkan kalian hidup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, tapi tidak pantas bagi Roseblade\Nuntuk mohon dibiarkan hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama bagi Keluarga Atlee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph. Kalau begitu, kalian mati saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona-Nona! Kalian aman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau dari akademi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sedang bantu evakuasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sudah evakuasi\Nwarga sipil setempat ke kapal lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berdua, cepat, kemari!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, sepertinya tidak semua pria akademi\Ntidak berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ja-Jangan remehkan aku, sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasakan itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kujelaskan semuanya padamu, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, kapal evakuasi sekutu\Nsudah tenggelam di Distrik Tiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kapal Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daniel... Raymond...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa ini harus terjadi ke semua orang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami temukan mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapten! Mereka tangkap Garrett!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.61,0:20:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, mereka benar-benar lakukan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubunuh mereka semua!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapten, bukankah itu\Nkesatria jahat yang dibicarakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Arroganz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya dia di penjara!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiap kali...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.53,0:20:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka aman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka cuma tidak sadar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap waspada. Katanya dia lumpuhkan armada\Ndan Kesatria Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi harusnya dia pengecut\Nyang tidak membunuh orang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jaga jarak! Kepung!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan dapat kehormatan\Nkalau jatuhkan dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, dengan lintasan itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa pun yang jatuhkan dia\Ndapat dua wanita di bawah sana juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:20:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pilotnya akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapten!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak perlu pikirkan itu,\NLeon Fou Bartfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sering lakukan ini di gim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang lakukan itu sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak perlu dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kapten...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini menyebalkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan memikirkan cari istri\Nlebih baik daripada ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau lari,\Nkau bisa saja hindari pertarungan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi akhirnya akan lebih buruk lagi,\Njadi aku akan bertarung!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan benci aku karena ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian yang taruh aku dalam posisi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss maju,\Nsementara Luxion jalankan misi lain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang tersisa cuma bola aneh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan orang-orang eksentrik?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan ini padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kau?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku serahkan apa pun padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Livia..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana topengku?!
